    "No password recovery. If you forget your sync password, your synced notes can't be recovered by anyone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No password recovery. If you forget your sync password, your synced notes can't be recovered by anyone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法找回密码。如果忘记同步密码，任何人都无法恢复你的同步笔记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync keeps your notes available on all your Macs through a WebDAV or S3-compatible storage location. Your notes are encrypted on this Mac before upload. Your storage provider receives only encrypted note data.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync keeps your notes available on all your Macs through a WebDAV or S3-compatible storage location. Your notes are encrypted on this Mac before upload. Your storage provider receives only encrypted note data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 WebDAV 或 S3 兼容的存储位置，让你的笔记在所有 Mac 上保持可用。笔记会先在这台 Mac 上加密再上传，存储服务商只会收到加密后的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync disconnected. Your notes and the data at the storage location were kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
